      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "STREET SIXTY SIX (1) turned spotting a big start finishing fifth (22.71) last time in a Grade 5 at this track. Form here sound including two wins. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings six times from 10 attempts. Should bounce back. ASTON EXCESS (8) drawn the outside box and could get a clear run. Was below best last time when 6th and beaten 4.5 lengths at Warrnambool (23.06). Form here at this distance is strong including one wins. Key runner who gets his chance to atone. PAW ZILLIE (3) goes very well this course and distance starting six times for two wins and two minors. Was out of the placings last time (22.76) at this track in a Restricted WIN, finishing sixth and beaten 9 lengths. Can hit the frame with the right run. KIANI STAR (7) has to be respected despite coming off a two months break.",
